        "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Hmmmm, depending on how annoying it gets to avoid that of cheating... and if I can get my hands on the artwork for the card backs I will try to make proxie cards for the stations and keep the actual station cards hidden somewhere else. Then when I draw the proxie I'll just blindly pull out the station card from the hidden stack.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
